OL,3,GNEWSAEx-England footballer Raheem
OL,4,ASterling being sentenced for dangerous
OL,5,Adriving
OL,6,
OL,7,FRaheem Sterling is being sentenced for
OL,8,Fdangerous driving at Basingstoke
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court
OL,11,FThe ex-England footballer, 31, was
OL,12,Farrested after crashing a Lamborghini
OL,13,Fnear the M3 in Hampshire on 28 May -
OL,14,Fpolice body-worn footage captured his
OL,15,Farrest
OL,17,FJason Bartfeld KC, for the defence,
OL,18,Fsays Sterling has "recognised the
OL,19,Fvarious unhealthy coping mechanisms
OL,20,Fthat brought him to this position"
