OL,3,GNEWSAEx-England footballer Raheem
OL,4,ASterling being sentenced for dangerous
OL,5,Adriving
OL,6,
OL,7,FSterling pleaded guilty to driving
OL,8,Fdangerously on the M3, the M25, the
OL,9,FA327 and Minley Road - he also admitted
OL,10,Fpossessing nitrous oxide, a Class C
OL,11,Fdrug, for wrongful inhalation, and
OL,12,Ffailing to provide a specimen for
OL,13,Fanalysis
OL,15,FEyewitnesses reported seeing the driver
OL,16,Fof a Lamborghini inhaling from a white
OL,17,Fballoon, with one woman initially
OL,18,Fbelieving an airbag had inflated
OL,20,FSterling has 82 England caps, the last
OL,21,Fof which was won at the 2022 World Cup
OL,22,Fin Qatar
